# 🚢 FreightQuote AI Platform – Milestone 2

# 📖 Project Overview

**FreightQuote AI Platform** is an AI-powered logistics and freight quotation system developed as part of the **Infosys Springboard Internship**.

Milestone 2 extends the authentication system developed in Milestone 1 by integrating:

- 🤖 Artificial Intelligence
- 📊 Machine Learning
- 🔒 Advanced Security Mechanisms
- 🧠 AI Copilot
- 👨‍💼 Admin Dashboard
- 🚢 Freight Analytics

The platform predicts freight costs, analyzes shipment delays, evaluates carrier compliance, and provides AI-assisted logistics recommendations through an interactive Streamlit dashboard.

