# 🏗️ System Architecture

```
                   USER

                     │

        Login / Registration / OTP

                     │

          JWT Authentication Layer

                     │

          SQLite + bcrypt Database

                     │

        Security Verification Engine

                     │

    ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐

    │              │              │

Agent 1       Agent 2        Agent 3

Pricing       Route Delay    Compliance

    │              │              │

    └──────────────┼──────────────┘

                     │

              AI Copilot (LLM)

                     │

        Executive Recommendations

                     │

            Admin Dashboard
```

