# 🔒 Security Features

## Progressive Account Lockout

| Failed Attempts | Action |
|-----------------|--------|
| 3 Attempts | Lock Account for 5 Minutes |
| 4 Attempts | Lock Account for 15 Minutes |
| 5 Attempts | Permanently Lock Account |

Only the Administrator can unlock permanently locked users.

---

## OTP Resend Cooldown

| Resend Attempt | Cooldown |
|----------------|----------|
| First | 60 Seconds |
| Second | 180 Seconds |
| Third | 300 Seconds |
| Fourth & Above | 1 Hour |

---

## Password Strength Validation

| Password Length | Strength |
|-----------------|----------|
| Less than 5 Characters | 🔴 Weak |
| 5–9 Characters | 🟡 Average |
| 10+ Characters | 🟢 Strong |

---

# 🤖 Machine Learning Agents

## 🚚 Agent 1 – Dynamic Freight Pricing

Predicts shipment cost based on logistics parameters.

### Algorithms Compared

- Random Forest Regressor
- Gradient Boosting Regressor
- Extra Trees Regressor
- Ridge Regression
- Decision Tree Regressor
- AdaBoost Regressor
- KNeighbors Regressor

### Output

- Predicted Freight Cost
- R² Score
- RMSE

---

## 🚛 Agent 2 – Route Delay Prediction

Predicts shipment delays using classification models.

### Algorithms Compared

- Random Forest
- Gradient Boosting
- Logistic Regression
- Support Vector Machine
- Extra Trees
- AdaBoost
- KNeighbors

### Output

- Delay Prediction
- ROC-AUC Score

---

## 📦 Agent 3 – Carrier Compliance Sentinel

Evaluates carrier performance and shipment compliance.

### Algorithms Compared

- Random Forest
- Gradient Boosting
- Extra Trees
- Logistic Regression
- AdaBoost
- Support Vector Machine

### Output

- Compliance Classification
- ROC-AUC Score

---

# 🧠 AI Copilot

The platform integrates the **Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct (4-bit Quantized)** Large Language Model.

### Features

- Freight Risk Analysis
- Logistics Question Answering
- Executive Recommendations
- Shipping Strategy Suggestions
- JSON Audit Report Generation

If GPU is unavailable, the application automatically switches to a rule-based fallback mode.

